Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:38.00,Hdr,,0,0,0,,February 22, 2025 - Saudi Cup
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Hong Kong's best, Romantic Warrior, leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:05.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Japan's star hope Forever Young is chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.70,0:00:08.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Hanging on - the front two have gone clear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:12.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Third, a long way back, Wilson Tesoro holds on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:14.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Closing from the outside is Ushba Tesoro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Japanese horses battling for third and fourth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:20.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,But up front, Romantic Warrior just leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:24.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Forever Young drives hard on the outside and catches him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:25.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Forever Young takes the lead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:28.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Romantic Warrior has to settle for second!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:31.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Forever Young wins! Forever Young first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:37.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,After so many close calls, Japan's star finally shines on the world stage!